  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objectives aim at increasing sustainable access to water services in the towns Namapa, Malema, Namialo, Nametil. This will be pursued by rehabilitating the existing water production and distribution, and extending the existing water production and distribution systems to increase service coverage of the systems.</narrative>
